386
00:40:01.559 --> 00:40:06.758
And don't keep feeding her water spinach
or your kid will be sleepy all the time.

387
00:40:08.559 --> 00:40:09.999
How about giving the baby some meat?

388
00:40:10.799 --> 00:40:12.239
