414
00:43:31.439 --> 00:43:36.479
I've been waiting for my first baby to come,
but it died.

415
00:43:36.559 --> 00:43:39.159
Be strong.

416
00:43:39.239 --> 00:43:41.559
It's easier said than done.

417
00:43:43.679 --> 00:43:45.918
I'm so depressed.

418
00:43:49.839 --> 00:43:52.479
