463
00:47:15.919 --> 00:47:17.839
What did I tell you?

464
00:47:17.879 --> 00:47:19.159
You helped a whore.

465
00:47:19.199 --> 00:47:20.879
I don't understand.

466
00:47:20.919 --> 00:47:22.279
